OL,3,GNEWSAMaternity services remain
OL,4,Asuspended at hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FBirthing services at a hospital in
OL,7,Fnorth Devon remain suspended following
OL,8,Fits latest "readiness assessment".
OL,10,FThe maternity unit at North Devon
OL,11,FDistrict Hospital (NDDH) has been
OL,12,Fclosed since 11 August due to staffing
OL,13,Fproblems, with expectant parents
OL,14,Fcalling the situation a "nightmare".
OL,16,FThe Royal Devon University Healthcare
OL,17,FNHS Foundation Trust said it remained
OL,18,F"committed to reopening birthing
OL,19,Fservices at NDDH as soon as possible"
OL,20,Fand was continuing its efforts to
OL,21,F"recruit both temporary and substantive
OL,22,Fstaff".
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
